admission-service.lab.jsonc
public-signer.cloud-run-lab.jsonc
# Production schedule-state rendered configs (Phase: inactive-by-default). They hold the account id and PUBLIC keys only. Never commit.
lifecycle-observer.production.jsonc
lifecycle-mailbox.production.armed.jsonc
lifecycle-observer.production.armed.jsonc
